            "typeName": "dataSources",
            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "Based on 222 reports concerning evaluation with the VSNU 1993, VSNU 1994 and VSNU 1998 protocols as well as the SEP 2003-2009 and SEP 2009-2015 protocols. For a complete list of reports, see the file 'Bijlage twintig jaar onderzoeksevaluatie'. \nData from organisations outside the scope of the protocol are not included.\nData from the Discipline-advies Geneeskunde 1994. Amsterdam: KNAW are not included due to deviation in score system used."
